Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?nemesis:=20Study=20page=20v1=20=E2=80=94=20FSRS?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20flashcards=20(ts-fsrs),=20deck=20browser,=20review=20flow,?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20paste=20import?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- src/app/study/{model.ts,import-cards.ts,index.tsx}: FSRS-6 scheduling (same
  algorithm family as modern Anki; zero AGPL code), deck grid with due badges,
  flip-card review with Again/Hard/Good/Easy + next-interval hints + Space/1-4
  keys, Quizlet-paste importer (tab / ' - ' / comma), seeded pharm demo deck,
  localStorage v1 persistence.
- wired: routes.ts (STUDY_ROUTE + view), sidebar nav item (mortar-board),
  desktop-controller lazy route, sidebar.nav i18n (en/zh/ja/zh-hant).
- dep: ts-fsrs ^5.4.1 (MIT).
